{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17505","headline":"端午日礼部宿斋有衣服彩结之贶以诗还荅 · 权德舆","name":"端午日礼部宿斋有衣服彩结之贶以诗还荅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"良辰当五日，偕老祝千年。\n彩缕同心丽，轻裾暎体鲜。\n寂寥斋画省，欵曲擘香牋。\n更想传觞处，孙孩徧目前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17505.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17505","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}